# Magnitude ↔ ODS Integration

## Role

Magnitude should sit above the ODS runtime layer as an application/agent workload rather than being treated as the inference backend itself.

## Proposed flow

```text
Magnitude
   │
   ▼
ODS model/workload selection
   │
   ▼
ODS runtime selector
   │
   ├── llama.cpp
   ├── MoE-Infinity
   ├── TensorFold
   └── other validated runtimes
   │
   ▼
OpenAI-compatible ODS endpoint
```

This keeps agent execution independent from the concrete inference engine.

## LEONES

LEONES should validate the complete chain independently: hardware profile → model/runtime selection → installation → health → benchmark → measured evidence.

**Classification:** application-layer integration reference.